# Twilio Voice Rules

## Request Path

```
Twilio webhook → Cloudflare Tunnel → Traefik → K8s service → backend pod → /api/twilio/webhook
  → AI/STT/TTS → TwiML or media response
```

## Key Files

- `routes/twilio/webhook.py` — Main IVR webhook
- `routes/twilio/smart_jump.py` — Intent-based menu skipping
- `services/llm/` — Intent classification, response generation
- `services/call_state/` — Call state persistence
- `utils/background_tasks.py` — Async LLM processing

## For Voice Issues, Always Check

- Webhook status code (Twilio Console → Monitor → Logs)
- TwiML validity (no malformed tags, valid XML)
- Call SID / correlation ID (`callSid`, `requestId` in logs)
- Ingress routing and service endpoints
- Pod readiness and init containers (Vault Agent)
- Timeout: backend gather (8s), Twilio webhook (15s), LLM latency
- Media/audio URL reachability from Twilio

